ercase">faq</p></div><div class="flex max-w-[640px] flex-col gap-4"><h2 class="font-display text-[22px] leading-7 font-medium text-white sm:text-[28px] sm:leading-[36px]">Questions?</h2><p class="font-label text-base leading-6 sm:text-lg sm:leading-[26px] text-muted">We have answers.</p></div></div><div class="border-t border-white/[0.06]"><div class="opacity-0 border-b border-white/[0.06] " style="animation-delay:0ms"><button type="button" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="faq-panel-0" class="flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-3 px-4 py-4 text-left focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:-outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-info sm:gap-4 sm:px-6"><span class="font-display text-base leading-6 font-medium text-white">What is Polysights, exactly?</span><span class="flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-[4px] bg-white/[0.06] p-2"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" src="/landing/faq/icon-minus.svg"/></span></button><div id="faq-panel-0" role="region" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-300 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)] motion-reduce:transition-none" style="grid-template-rows:1fr"><div class="overflow-hidden"><p class="px-4 pb-4 text-base leading-6 text-text-secondary sm:px-6">An intelligence and analytics layer built on top of Polymarket for advanced trade execution and analytics.</p></div></div></div><div class="opacity-0  " style="animation-delay:80ms"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-panel-1" class="flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-3 px-4 py-4 text-left focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:-outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-info sm:gap-4 sm:px-6"><span class="font-display text-base leading-6 font-medium text-white">Do I need to connect a wallet?</span><span class="flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-[4px] bg-white/[0.06] p-2"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" src="/landing/faq/icon-plus.svg"/></span></button><div id="faq-panel-1" role="region" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-300 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)] motion-reduce:transition-none" style="grid-template-rows:0fr"><div class="overflow-hidden" inert=""><p class="px-4 pb-4 text-base leading-6 text-text-secondary sm:px-6">Nope, we handle it all on our side, though you can import your own wallet if you&#x27;d like.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><div aria-hidden="true" class="slanted-divider h-10 w-full border-y border-[#1A1A1A] bg-background sm:h-16"></div><section class="relative w-full overflow-hidden bg-background"><div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0"><canvas aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-[72px] h-[88%] w-full opacity-25 sm:opacity-60"></canvas><div class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-[72px] h-[100px] bg-gradient-to-b from-transparent to-[rgba(11,11,11,0.85)]"></div></div><div class="landing-gutter relative w-full"><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[1440px] border-x border-white/[0.06]"><div class="relative flex flex-col items-center px-4 pt-16 pb-14 text-center sm:px-10 sm:pt-[110px] sm:pb-[90px]"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-x-[9px] gap-y-1 opacity-0" style="animation-delay:0ms"><span class="pulse-dot size-1 rounded-full bg-positive"></span><p class="font-body text-sm text-muted">Volume tracked on Polysights and counting</p><p class="font-label text-sm font-semibold text-white">$5.7B</p></div><h2 class="mt-[22px] max-w-[1020px] text-[clamp(26px,4.5vw,48px)] leading-[1.1] font-medium tracking-[-0.02em] text-white sm:leading-none opacity-0" style="animation-delay:120ms">The room is open.</h2><p class="mt-3.5 max-w-[460px] font-label text-base leading-[1.55] text-muted opacity-0" style="animation-delay:240ms">Everything above is live in the terminal right now, no waitlist this time.</p><div class="mt-8 fl